 We came as soon as we were told what was happening. The High Order is here to serve Zephras.\",\"timestamp\":1794377721,\"id\":\"s1_2646\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: ...and the Windshapers. We are ready to support an assault on the Shrine, Valennia.\",\"timestamp\":1794377727,\"id\":\"s1_2647\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: You have my thanks. Being truthful, however, this is going to be a dangerous gambit and we may not succeed. It's important you understand that this might be a one-way ride.\",\"timestamp\":1794377732,\"id\":\"s1_2648\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: We understand. As it happens Elaadrin and I spoke. We made arrangements to send for... outside aid. It's unclear if they will be able to arrive in time to help, or if they will even arrive at all...\",\"timestamp\":1794377742,\"id\":\"s1_2649\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Defense has increased to 63.\",\"timestamp\":1794377847,\"id\":\"s1_2650\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Maces has increased to 57.\",\"t