text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:765::::::::5:1484:::::::::|h[Silverleaf]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1794457559,\"id\":\"s1_3007\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Herbalism has increased to 10.\",\"timestamp\":1794457593,\"id\":\"s1_3008\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2447::::::::5:1484:::::::::|h[Peacebloom]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1794457594,\"id\":\"s1_3009\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Herbalism has increased to 11.\",\"timestamp\":1794457626,\"id\":\"s1_3010\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:765::::::::5:1484:::::::::|h[Silverleaf]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1794457626,\"id\":\"s1_3011\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Go on and have a seat near the fire and we can get started.\",\"timestamp\":1794457655,\"id\":\"s1_3012\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: All you need to start a camp of your own is a basic campfire. Cooks can generally teach you how to make one of those.\",\"timestamp\":1794457660,\"id\":\"s1_3013\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Once your campfire is down, you can place all sorts of camp fixtures around it.\",\"timestamp\":1794457668,\"id\":\"s1_3014\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Sufficiently skilled leatherworkers, for example, can place a tent like this one behind me.\",\"timestamp\":1794457674,\"id\":\"s1_3015\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Every trade has something they can contribute to your camp, even fishermen!\",\"timestamp\":1794457681,\"id\":\"s1_3016\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Then, all you need to do is have a seat near the fire and soak it all in. After a few minutes of resting, you'll gain various boons that will help you in your travels.\",\"timestamp\":1794457686,\"id\":\"s1_3017\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: If you just sit still and rest for a few more moments, you'll gain a benefit from having rested near the tent I have set up behind me.\",\"timestamp\":1794457697,\"id\":\"s1_3018\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: That's about the gist of it. Once you've gained your boon from resting near the fire, speak with me again.\",\"timestamp\":1794457705,\"id\":\"s1_3019\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Ari Santo\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ari Santo:318:TEXT_EMOTE:|h|cff0070ddAri Santo|r|h tells a joke to Raan Wildwind.\",\"timestamp\":1794457717,\"id\":\"s1_3020\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Ari Santo\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ari Santo:327:TEXT_EMOTE:|h|cff0070ddAri Santo|r|h tells a joke to Raan Wildwind.\",\"timestamp\":1794457725,\"id\":\"s1_3021\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"You have gained the Cooking skill.\",\"timestamp\":1794457847,\"id\":\"s1_3022\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"You have gained the Enchanting skill.\",\"timestamp\":1794457875,\"id\":\"s1_3023\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Illaya Amberwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Illaya Amberwind says: As you likely know, the wind pylons gifted to us by the spirits serve as our anchor to the elemental plane of Skywall. They are failing, and our home is in danger.\",\"timestamp\":1794457945,\"id\":\"s1_3024\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Illaya Amberwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Illaya Amberwind says: The Al'Aketh cult continues to escalate their violence, and the High Order's magical meddling could hasten our doom if left unchecked.\",\"timestamp\":1794457954,\"id\":\"s1_3025\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Illaya Amberwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Illaya Amberwind says: The Windshapers possess the gift of skysight, and we are working tirelessly to find our lost elemental benefactors, so that they may guide us once again.\",\"timestamp\":1794457963,\"id\":\"s1_3026\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Constable Aonda\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Constable Aonda says: If you are looking for more work, I'm sure there are some folks in town that are also looking for help with one task or another. Just ask around, you are bound to find something.\",\"timestamp\":1794457964,\"id\":\"s1_3027\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Illaya Amberwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Illaya Amberwind says: The shamanistic magic we know is greatly diminished since the spirits vanished, but we are resolute in our mission to bring them home once again.\",\"timestamp\":1794457972,\"id\":\"s1_3028\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Illaya Amberwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Illaya Amberwind says: We will not stop until we are able to discover what went wrong. We will find the strength we need to call the spirits back to us.\",\"timestamp\":1794457983,\"id\":\"s1_3029\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Illaya Amberwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Illaya Amberwind says: The future is uncertain for our people, but there is hope, and we have a plan...\",\"timestamp\":1794457991,\"id\":\"s1_3030\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Illaya Amberwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Illaya Amberwind says: When you find yourself in the port of Valanaar, seek out Ayessa Dawnsinger. She can tell you more.\",\"timestamp\":1794457997,\"id\":\"s1_3031\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:5469::::::::6:1484:::::::::|h[Strider Meat]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1794458079,\"id\":\"s1_3032\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\