ame\":\"Sir Culation\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"level\":25},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sir Culation:1196:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaSir Culation|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001well i just realized I dont have to do BFD yet\",\"timestamp\":1794542660,\"id\":\"s1_4804\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1201:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001dead cows on the ground\",\"timestamp\":1794542666,\"id\":\"s1_4805\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Sir Culation\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"level\":25},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sir Culation:1203:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaSir Culation|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001just farm something outside, I go back there later so SFK is first anyway\",\"timestamp\":1794542670,\"id\":\"s1_4806\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather says: I tell you lot, that forest is haunted! I SAW *hic* WHAT I SAW!\",\"timestamp\":1794542680,\"id\":\"s1_4807\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Donaal Downbreeze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Donaal Downbreeze says: Oh, enough of that crazy talk, swimmers. You are going to scare off the few customers we have with your drunken ghost stories!\",\"timestamp\":1794542684,\"id\":\"s1_4808\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather says: If you don't believe me, go and see for yourself! Terrible windblown wraiths *hic*... forest spirits that will gnaw your ankles!\",\"timestamp\":1794542692,\"id\":\"s1_4809\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: My wife and I run the stormapple orchard in the lowlands, just to the west of Valanaar.\",\"timestamp\":1794542692,\"id\":\"s1_4810\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: Some years ago our farm was attacked by bandits. They took everything we had and left me bruised and bloody. The next season around the same time, they returned.\",\"timestamp\":1794542697,\"id\":\"s1_4811\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather says: There's even a terrible forest wraith! Dressed all in black and... evil looking! I tell you, it's a cursed place! *hic*\",\"timestamp\":1794542699,\"id\":\"s1_4812\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: They took most of our harvest again, but this time the bandit leader--Ferauu \\\"the Bludgeon\\\" as he's known--told us that every season they'd return and take twice as much as the previous year.\",\"timestamp\":1794542705,\"id\":\"s1_4813\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1219:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001got it\",\"timestamp\":1794542716,\"id\":\"s1_4814\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: We tried to petition the peacekeepers to come and help drive the bandits off, but they are stretched too thin just dealing with the cult and couldn't spare anyone.\",\"timestamp\":1794542716,\"id\":\"s1_4815\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: This year our yield is light and we can't hope to give them what they expect. The best case is that they simply kill us quickly. It's more likely they take everything we have and leave us to starve.\",\"timestamp\":1794542725,\"id\":\"s1_4816\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1222:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001wtf he despawned\",\"timestamp\":1794542729,\"id\":\"s1_4817\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: I came to town to hire fighters to drive them off. I found one warrior who agreed to help, but he robbed me as soon as we were out of town and nearly beat me to death.\",\"timestamp\":1794542736,\"id\":\"s1_4818\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: At this point I'm too injured to leave this bed. I'm begging you, stranger. Travel to my orchard. Tell Aamelia what happened and help her survive this somehow. Please, stranger... help us.\",\"timestamp\":1794542745,\"id\":\"s1_4819\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Sir Culation\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"level\":25},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sir Culation:1231:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaSir Culation|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001how long do i have until youre ready to do SFK will, can i do the other step in the meantime?\",\"timestamp\":1794542804,\"id\":\"s1_4820\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event