\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1327:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001hes stealing my silk now!\",\"timestamp\":1794543504,\"id\":\"s1_4845\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1334:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001i did it!\",\"timestamp\":1794543587,\"id\":\"s1_4846\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1335:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001took u long enough mage\",\"timestamp\":1794543608,\"id\":\"s1_4847\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1337:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001for sure lol\",\"timestamp\":1794543616,\"id\":\"s1_4848\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: As you know, our way of life is in grave danger. Since the elementals vanished, our people have been in a state of steady decline.\",\"timestamp\":1794543650,\"id\":\"s1_4849\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1345:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001dots tagging makes it kind crazy for you\",\"timestamp\":1794543655,\"id\":\"s1_4850\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The Al'Aketh are a symptom of this. In many ways they are a dark mirror into the hearts of the Windshapers. Many of us believe that we are to blame for the spirits leaving us.\",\"timestamp\":1794543658,\"id\":\"s1_4851\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1347:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001boom got em down\",\"timestamp\":1794543665,\"id\":\"s1_4852\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Whatever the cause, we need to find a solution quickly before we tear ourselves apart. Tell me, what do you know of Kalimdor?\",\"timestamp\":1794543668,\"id\":\"s1_4853\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1349:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001multi pulling ftw\",\"timestamp\":1794543674,\"id\":\"s1_4854\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The cradle of our people is now part of an even larger world known as \\\"Azeroth\\\". There are those on Azeroth possessing a skysight so strong that they can pierce the heavens themselves to see beyond.\",\"timestamp\":1794543675,\"id\":\"s1_4855\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Shamans, much like myself, but orders of magnitude more powerful. This power and their knowledge of the elemental planes is the key to our survival.\",\"timestamp\":1794543686,\"id\":\"s1_4856\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: In my own clumsy searching throughout the planes for signs of our elemental benefactors, I stumbled upon them...\",\"timestamp\":1794543694,\"id\":\"s1_4857\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: An entire order of visionaries just like the Windshapers called The Earthen Ring. One of their leaders, a shaman named Muln Earthfury, has shown me much.\",\"timestamp\":1794543701,\"id\":\"s1_4858\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1355:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001bet you'll never know what thats like, MAGE\",\"timestamp\":1794543702,\"id\":\"s1_4859\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1356:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001hahahaha\",\"timestamp\":1794543705,\"id\":\"s1_4860\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: I have seen the way. We must return to Kalimdor, confer with this Earthen Ring. They will help us master the skysight so that we may call our elemental patrons back home.\",\"timestamp\":1794543710,\"id\":\"s1_4861\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: However, this journey will be dangerous. We need strong, able-bodied young shen'dorei to join us as we explore this massive new world. Those just like you, in fact.\",\"timestamp\":1794543719,\"id\":\"s1_4862\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1359:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001THE COCOON! NOOOOO\",\"timestamp\":1794543728,\"id\":\"s1_4863\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: You do not need to agree to this now. When the time comes, however, please consider joining us in our expedition. Until we speak again... may the winds guide your path.\",\"timestamp\":1794543728,\"id\":\"s1_4864\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1365:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001?\",\"timestamp\":1794543739,\"id\":\"s1_4865\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Endaria Mistgaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Endaria Mistgaze says: Oh, and a word of warning before you head up to Shadowgale Forest. It's incredibly dangerous up there. Some even say it's haunted. Make sure you are prepared and well-equipped if you plan to make the trek.\",\"timestamp\":1794543746,\"id\":\"s1_4866\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1369:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001i gotta kil the elite again!!!\",\"timestamp\":1794543757,\"id\":\"s1_4867\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1370:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001LOL\",\"timestamp\":1794543761,\"id\":\"s1_4868\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1371:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001I\\\"M SO MAD\",\"timestamp\":1794543772,\"id\":\"s1_4869\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1378:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001yeah thats kinda a dick move by blizzard\",\"timestamp\":1794543783,\"id\":\"s1_4870\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: This construct might as well be a paperweight. Someone stole some of its most important components.\",\"timestamp\":1794543786,\"id\":\"s1_4871\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: Replacement parts are hard to come by these days, with how few intact constructs we have left on the island.\",\"timestamp\":1794543792,\"id\":\"s1_4872\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: If you want to try and find the components we need, I won't stop you, but it might require more than a little bit of scavenging.\",\"timestamp\":1794543799,\"id\":\"s1_4873\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: Shrieklings tend to hoard shiny things in their lairs, so it's possible some construct parts may have ended up in the shriekling cave just west of Valanaar.\",\"timestamp\":1794543806,\"id\":\"s1_4874\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: Constructs used to help us trawl Windsong Lake and when the pylons started to fail, many fell into the depths. There may be usable parts on the lakebed if you are up for a swim.\",\"timestamp\":1794543815,\"id\":\"s1_4875\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1385:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001brb\",\"timestamp\":1794543816,\"id\":\"s1_4876\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: Lastly, the bandit highwaymen common in the Gustberry Lowlands are known to hoard a variety of junk at their camps. Construct parts are likely to be found among such loot.\",\"timestamp\":1794543825,\"id\":\"s1_4877\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1391:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001instant \",\"id\":\"s1_4878\",\"timestamp\":1794543866},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1392:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001inv\",\"id\":\"s1_4879\",\"timestamp\":1794543870},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1394:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001discord?\",\"id\":\"s1_4880\",\"timestamp\":1794543889},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1395:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001sure, lemme get to UC first\",\"id\":\"s1_4881\",\"timestamp\":1794543901},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Skinning has increased to 74.\",\"id\":\"s1_4882\",\"timestamp\":1794543915},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2318::::::::9:1485:::::::::|h[Light Leather]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4883\",\"timestamp\":1794543916},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Sir Culation\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"level\":25},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sir Culation:1399:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaSir Culation|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001which \",\"id\":\"s1_4884\",\"timestamp\":1794543922},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Aes Bavits\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":32},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1400:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001tavern\",\"id\":\"s1_4885\",\"timestamp\":1794543938},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: Alvarion? Oh he's still in the hills with the peacekeepers, clearing out the rest of your lackeys. I'm sure they'll be along any minute and would love to see you.\",\"id\":\"s1_4886\",\"timestamp\":1794543959},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon says: HA! A poor bluff! Ferauu has eyes and ears everywhere. I know that it's just you and this scrawny stranger here. You've had your fun putting down a few of my weaker recruits, but The Bludgeon is here now and the party is over. Time to pay up, with interest.\",\"id\":\"s1_4887\",\"timestamp\":1794543967},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia raises her pitchfork, ready to fight.\",\"id\":\"s1_4888\",\"timestamp\":1794543981},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: I'm done talking. Stranger, thanks for everything...\",\"id\":\"s1_4889\",\"timestamp\":1794543984},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct yells: THREAT DETECTED. ADMINISTERING VIOLENCE.\",\"id\":\"s1_4890\",\"timestamp\":1794543986},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: Huh. Well that was... unexpected. I guess we know what that big lug's purpose is now. Let's head back to the house, stranger.\",\"id\":\"s1_4891\",\"timestamp\":1794543994},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct yells: FUNCTION FULFILLED. RESUMING REST MODE.\",\"id\":\"s1_4892\",\"timestamp\":1794543995},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:253666::::::::9:1485::11:::::::|h[Flutterfly Swatter]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4893\",\"timestamp\":1794544031},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: It's time, stranger. One way or another, let's finish this.\",\"id\":\"s1_4894\",\"timestamp\":1794544031},{\"recordedBy