]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1794553381,\"id\":\"s2_3182\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 41 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1794553382,\"id\":\"s2_3183\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:252030::::::::13:1485:::::::::|h[Pungent Skycheddar]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1794553383,\"id\":\"s2_3184\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2589::::::::13:1485:::::::::|h[Linen Cloth]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1794553383,\"id\":\"s2_3185\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:255663::::::::13:1485:::::::::|h[Windstone]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1794553383,\"id\":\"s2_3186\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 34 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1794553384,\"id\":\"s2_3187\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Simonhunter, ensure any allies with you are prepared to fight, and speak with me when you are ready to confront Lorthuna.\",\"timestamp\":1794553410,\"id\":\"s2_3188\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Ayessa... my former sister. How far you've fallen, keeping company with this High Order filth.\",\"timestamp\":1794553434,\"id\":\"s2_3189\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Lorthuna! Stop this madness. You don't know what bringing down the wards protecting Zephras will do. You could doom us all!\",\"timestamp\":1794553439,\"id\":\"s2_3190\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Bring the wards down? The wards have been down for days, fools. No, I am merely lighting a beacon... for the true servants of Al'Akir to follow.\",\"timestamp\":1794553446,\"id\":\"s2_3191\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: I'll make this easy for you, witch. Stop what you are doing now and I will make your death swift. This is the last and best offer you will get from the High Order.\",\"timestamp\":1794553454,\"id\":\"s2_3192\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Empty threats, Elaadrin. Regardless of what happens to me now, my great work is done. Consider yourself lucky to be here at the eye of the storm, to witness the fruits of our labor.\",\"timestamp\":1794553463,\"id\":\"s2_3193\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Ahh... yes! The call has been answered. Meet your end with joy!\",\"timestamp\":1794553473,\"id\":\"s2_3194\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Who dares call the Lord of the East Wind?\",\"timestamp\":1794553479,\"id\":\"s2_3195\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Wait... what is this place? How could such a place exist in the Windlord's realm?\",\"timestamp\":1794553485,\"id\":\"s2_3196\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: So the rumors were true. My wayward brothers did well to conceal this place from the gaze of Al'Akir.\",\"timestamp\":1794553491,\"id\":\"s2_3197\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Yes! Yes! It is by my will that the way to Zephras is open to you! Bring me before your Windlord so that he may know who was the herald of his glory!\",\"timestamp\":1794553499,\"id\":\"s2_3198\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: You dare to command me, mortal? No, I think not. Begone, insignificant elf!\",\"timestamp\":1794553507,\"id\":\"s2_3199\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: No! Never, I would never dare!\",\"timestamp\":1794553512,\"id\":\"s2_3200\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Well, you certainly never will again, insect. Hah!\",\"timestamp\":1794553513,\"id\":\"s2_3201\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Enjoy your remaining time as \\\"guests\\\" in my lord's realm until his judgement inevitably arrives. You'll know not when, but it is coming.\",\"timestamp\":1794553517,\"id\":\"s2_3202\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Now that this wondrous realm is no longer hidden from us, you are going to enjoy getting to know the TRUE children of Skywall...\",\"timestamp\":1794553525,\"id\":\"s2_3203\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muln Earthfury\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Muln Earthfury says: Sorry that we are late, Ayessa.\",\"timestamp\":1794553562,\"id\":\"s2_3204\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver says: It took a bit of work to convince Archmage Rhonin to help me open that transplanar portal...\",\"timestamp\":1794553566,\"id\":\"s2_3205\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: Ansirem! This isn't how I expected our first meeting to go, but I'm glad you made it!\",\"timestamp\":1794553573,\"id\":\"s2_3206\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Nor is this how I envisioned our first meeting, Muln.\",\"timestamp\":1794553578,\"id\":\"s2_3207\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Well if this isn't an inspirational sight. The little elves seem to have friends in... low places.\",\"timestamp\":1794553582,\"id\":\"s2_3208\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muln Earthfury\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Muln Earthfury says: We have no quarrel with you, Lord of the East Wind. Leave us in peace.\",\"timestamp\":1794553586,\"id\":\"s2_3209\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Very well, mortals. For now enjoy your respite. I simply cannot wait to tell the Windlord about all that has transpired here. You will be seeing me again... very soon.\",\"timestamp\":1794553590,\"id\":\"s2_3210\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Simonhunter Windseeker:3094:PARTY:|h[|cffaad372Simonhunter Windseeker|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001|TInterface\\\\Addons\\\\Questie\\\\Icons\\\\questie.png:0|t 1/1 Confront Lorthuna for |Hquestie:92646:Player-6933-018019EA|h|cFFFFFF00[|r|cFFFFFF00[12] Confront Lorthuna |cFF00ff00(Complete)|r|r|cFFFFFF00]|r|h!\",\"timestamp\":1794553593,\"id\":\"s2_3211\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Tsuki Whispergale\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Tsuki Whispergale:3095:PARTY:|h[|cffff7c0aTsuki Whispergale|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001|TInterface\\\\Addons\\\\Questie\\\\Icons\\\\questie.png:0|t 1/1 Confront Lorthuna for |Hquestie:92646:Player-6794-0041DFC5|h|cFFFFFF00[|r|cFFFFFF00[12] Confront Lorthuna |cFF00ff00(Complete)|r|r|cFFFFFF00]|r|h!\",\"timestamp\":1794553593,\"id\":\"s2_3212\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: I think it's time for us to be leaving this place. I will open a portal to Valanaar.\",\"timestamp\":1794553598,\"id\":\"s2_3213\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Muln Earthfury of the Earthen Ring--the Windshapers would be happy to accept you as our guest.\",\"timestamp\":1794553602,\"id\":\"s2_3214\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: Yes, and you, Archmage Runeweaver. The High Order is eager to learn more of the Kirin Tor.\",\"timestamp\":1794553608,\"id\":\"s2_3215\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Order Messenger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Order Messenger says: Ayessa Dawnsinger. The Supreme Magister of the High Order awaits your reply to his inquiry.\",\"timestamp\":1794553660,\"id\":\"s2_3216\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Inquiry? You mean his thinly veiled threat? You go back and tell Elaadrin that if he has something to say, he can come and speak to me himself.\",\"timestamp\":1794553665,\"id\":\"s2_3217\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Order Messenger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Order Messenger says: Skyseer, need I remind you that High Order blood has been spilled? We would have those responsible answer for this crime.\",\"timestamp\":1794553673,\"id\":\"s2_3218\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Oh, that's rich, little mage. What of the Windshapers that your agent killed in the highlands? Who will answer for them?\",\"timestamp\":1794553680,\"id\":\"s2_3219\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: No one? I thought not. You go tell Elaadrin that the only thing keeping me from marching my shamans over and tossing you petty charlatans off the side of this island is the current crisis.\",\"timestamp\":1794553689,\"id\":\"s2_3220\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:273875::::::::13:1485::11:::::::|h[Empyrean Treads]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1794553697,\"id\":\"s2_3221\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Order Messenger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"