{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonrogue Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Simonrogue Windseeker:1698:GUILD:|h[|cfffff468Simonrogue Windseeker|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001idk. dont throw lore at me\",\"id\":\"s2_4720\",\"timestamp\":1794619854},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonrogue Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Simonrogue Windseeker:1700:GUILD:|h[|cfffff468Simonrogue Windseeker|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001i just thought arthas was a paladin\",\"id\":\"s2_4721\",\"timestamp\":1794619859},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Milky Fingers\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"level\":26},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Milky Fingers:1702:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dMilky Fingers|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001well yeah\",\"id\":\"s2_4722\",\"timestamp\":1794619865},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Milky Fingers\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"level\":26},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Milky Fingers:1708:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dMilky Fingers|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001he was\",\"id\":\"s2_4723\",\"timestamp\":1794619870},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: As you know, our way of life is in grave danger. Since the elementals vanished, our people have been in a state of steady decline.\",\"id\":\"s2_4724\",\"timestamp\":1794619870},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Lightly Toasty\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Lightly Toasty:1713:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaLightly Toasty|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001He was an unhinged paladin\",\"id\":\"s2_4725\",\"timestamp\":1794619876},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The Al'Aketh are a symptom of this. In many ways they are a dark mirror into the hearts of the Windshapers. Many of us believe that we are to blame for the spirits leaving us.\",\"id\":\"s2_4726\",\"timestamp\":1794619878},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Rordan Gamsey\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"level\":27},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Rordan Gamsey:1716:GUILD:|h[|cfffff468Rordan Gamsey|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001Arthus was a manager at kfc\",\"id\":\"s2_4727\",\"timestamp\":1794619880},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Endaria Mistgaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Endaria Mistgaze says: Oh, and a word of warning before you head up to Shadowgale Forest. It's incredibly dangerous up there. Some even say it's haunted. Make sure you are prepared and well-equipped if you plan to make the trek.\",\"id\":\"s2_4728\",\"timestamp\":1794619887},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Whatever the cause, we need to find a solution quickly before we tear ourselves apart. Tell me, what do you know of Kalimdor?\",\"id\":\"s2_4729\",\"timestamp\":1794619888},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":31},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1722:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001honestly i thought he was kinda based\",\"id\":\"s2_4730\",\"timestamp\":1794619893},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Lightly Toasty\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Lightly Toasty:1723:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaLightly Toasty|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001Seriously gives new meaning to Lawful good doesnt mean lawful nice\",\"id\":\"s2_4731\",\"timestamp\":1794619893},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The cradle of our people is now part of an even larger world known as \\\"Azeroth\\\". There are those on Azeroth possessing a skysight so strong that they can pierce the heavens themselves to see beyond.\",\"id\":\"s2_4732\",\"timestamp\":1794619895},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":31},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1726:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001they all WERE gonna turn!\",\"id\":\"s2_4733\",\"timestamp\":1794619899},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Shamans, much like myself, but orders of magnitude more powerful. This power and their knowledge of the elemental planes is the key to our survival.\",\"id\":\"s2_4734\",\"timestamp\":1794619906},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: In my own clumsy searching throughout the planes for signs of our elemental benefactors, I stumbled upon them...\",\"id\":\"s2_4735\",\"timestamp\":1794619914},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: An entire order of visionaries just like the Windshapers called The Earthen Ring. One of their leaders, a shaman named Muln Earthfury, has shown me much.\",\"id\":\"s2_4736\",\"timestamp\":1794619921},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: I have seen the way. We must return to Kalimdor, confer with this Earthen Ring. They will help us master the skysight so that we may call our elemental patrons back home.\",\"id\":\"s2_4737\",\"timestamp\":1794619929},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Lightly Toasty\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"level\":30},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Lightly Toasty:1744:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaLightly Toasty|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001He was selfish\",\"id\":\"s2_4738\",\"timestamp\":1794619936},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: However, this journey will be dangerous. We need strong, able-bodied young shen'dorei to join us as we explore this massive new world. Those just like you, in fact.\",\"id\":\"s2_4739\",\"timestamp\":1794619939},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: You do not need to agree to this now. When the time comes, however, please consider joining us in our expedition. Until we speak again... may the winds guide your path.\",\"id\":\"s2_4740\",\"timestamp\":1794619948},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonrogue Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.25098040699