2_4772\",\"timestamp\":1794620477},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Defense has increased to 40.\",\"id\":\"s2_4773\",\"timestamp\":1794620545},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: Alvarion? Oh he's still in the hills with the peacekeepers, clearing out the rest of your lackeys. I'm sure they'll be along any minute and would love to see you.\",\"id\":\"s2_4774\",\"timestamp\":1794620565},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon says: HA! A poor bluff! Ferauu has eyes and ears everywhere. I know that it's just you and this scrawny stranger here. You've had your fun putting down a few of my weaker recruits, but The Bludgeon is here now and the party is over. Time to pay up, with interest.\",\"id\":\"s2_4775\",\"timestamp\":1794620573},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia raises her pitchfork, ready to fight.\",\"id\":\"s2_4776\",\"timestamp\":1794620587},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonrogue-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: I'm done talking. Stranger, thanks for everything...\",\"id\":\"s2_4777\",\"timestamp\