SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: Alvarion? Oh he's still in the hills with the peacekeepers, clearing out the rest of your lackeys. I'm sure they'll be along any minute and would love to see you.\",\"timestamp\":1794679402,\"id\":\"s3_4557\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon says: HA! A poor bluff! Ferauu has eyes and ears everywhere. I know that it's just you and this scrawny stranger here. You've had your fun putting down a few of my weaker recruits, but The Bludgeon is here now and the party is over. Time to pay up, with interest.\",\"timestamp\":1794679410,\"id\":\"s3_4558\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonwarrior Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"level\":11},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You create: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2840::::::::11:1491:::::::::|h[Copper Bar]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1794679650,\"id\":\"s3_4559\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonwarrior Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"level\":11},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You create: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2840::::::::11:1491:::::::::|h[Copper Bar]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1794679653,\"id\":\"s3_4560\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Mining has increased to 66.\",\"timestamp\":1794679653,\"id\":\"s3_4561\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",