f]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s4_3581\",\"timestamp\":1794713077},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:6889::::::::13:1484:::::::::|h[Small Egg]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3582\",\"timestamp\":1794713107},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:4776::::::::13:1484:::::::::|h[Ruffled Feather]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3583\",\"timestamp\":1794713107},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:211780::::::::13:1484:::::::::|h[Scroll: KWYJIBO]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3584\",\"timestamp\":1794713107},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Herbalism has increased to 75.\",\"id\":\"s4_3585\",\"timestamp\":1794713112},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:765::::::::13:1484:::::::::|h[Silverleaf]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3586\",\"timestamp\":1794713113},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263330::::::::13:1484::11:::::::|h[Tracker's Pants]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3587\",\"timestamp\":1794713462},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: Wait, yes... this crystal! Valennia, is this...\",\"id\":\"s4_3588\",\"timestamp\":1794713467},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: ...a recall crystal! Used to record an important moment, no doubt.\",\"id\":\"s4_3589\",\"timestamp\":1794713471},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: This is surely what the turncoat hoped to offer us in exchange for our protection.\",\"id\":\"s4_3590\",\"timestamp\":1794713475},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: The recall crystal is badly damaged, though. The recording is likely to be incomplete, so we must listen carefully.\",\"id\":\"s4_3591\",\"timestamp\":1794713481},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: Activate it, Valennia. We need to learn as much as we can about what it contains.\",\"id\":\"s4_3592\",\"timestamp\":1794713489},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: ...do not delay. Muster our forces to march immediately. The pylons are key and...the wards...come down. This is...\",\"id\":\"s4_3593\",\"timestamp\":1794713498},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: ...quickly. With our forces.....will be exposed.....my ritual must not....\",\"id\":\"s4_3594\",\"timestamp\":1794713505},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: I alone am.....this task....the Windlord will.......our voices.....he will come.....we must not fail!\",\"id\":\"s4_3595\",\"timestamp\":1794713511},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Nyx Mesai\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SAY\",\"type\":\"SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Nyx Mesai:774:SAY:|h[|cfffff468Nyx Mesai|r]|h says: [Darnassian] eat it CRICKET\",\"id\":\"s4_3596\",\"timestamp\":1794713516},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: The crystal is too damaged to play any further, I am afraid.\",\"id\":\"s4_3597\",\"timestamp\":1794713519},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: With the cult running roughshod over most of the island with impunity, Lorthuna undoubtedly thinks we are on the back foot. We can use that overconfidence against her.\",\"id\":\"s4_3598\",\"timestamp\":1794713525},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: Wards... what is this about wards, Valennia?\",\"id\":\"s4_3599\",\"timestamp\":1794713525},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: The anchor pylons keep us suspended in this realm, but they also act as wards! The Shal'nan once spoke of this. They keep us shielded from...\",\"id\":\"s4_3600\",\"timestamp\":1794713530},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: I believe that with a proper distraction at the shrine, a small force of Peacekeepers, Windshapers, and High Order should be able to push up a flank and break into the inner sanctum. From there, we take out the High Priestess herself and cut the head off the snake.\",\"id\":\"s4_3601\",\"timestamp\":1794713534},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: ...whatever else is out there in Skywall. Spirits save us... this is her plan. Bring down the wards and let her 'Windlord' in!\",\"id\":\"s4_3602\",\"timestamp\":1794713540},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Order Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Order Mage says: Watch yourself. The High Order will not tolerate hostility in our lodge.\",\"id\":\"s4_3603\",\"timestamp\":1794713719},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:257344::::::::13:1484::11:::::::|h[Skywatcher's Vestments]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3604\",\"timestamp\":1794713798},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: We came as soon as we were told what was happening. The High Order is here to serve Zephras.\",\"id\":\"s4_3605\",\"timestamp\":1794713853},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: ...and the Windshapers. We are ready to support an assault on the Shrine, Valennia.\",\"id\":\"s4_3606\",\"timestamp\":1794713859},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: You have my thanks. Being truthful, however, this is going to be a dangerous gambit and we may not succeed. It's important you understand that this might be a one-way ride.\",\"id\":\"s4_3607\",\"timestamp\":1794713864},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: We understand. As it happens Elaadrin and I spoke. We made arrangements to send for... outside aid. It's unclear if they will be able to arrive in time to help, or if they will even arrive at all...\",\"id\":\"s4_3608\",\"timestamp\":1794713873},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:4776::::::::13:1484:::::::::|h[Ruffled Feather]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3609\",\"timestamp\":1794713878},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: Outside... of Zephras? From the other provinces? We haven't had contact with the other islands for years...?\",\"id\":\"s4_3610\",\"timestamp\":1794713884},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2447::::::::13:1484:::::::::|h[Peacebloom]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3611\",\"timestamp\":1794713884},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: It's... coming from a little further away than that. We'll explain on the way.\",\"id\":\"s4_3612\",\"timestamp\":1794713891},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: Very well then. Time is not with us so we should make ourselves ready. Thank you all for your aid. Zephras is in your debt.\",\"id\":\"s4_3613\",\"timestamp\":1794713895},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Herbalism has increased to 76.\",\"id\":\"s4_3614\",\"timestamp\":1794713985},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2449::::::::13:1484:::::::::|h[Earthroot]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s4_3615\",\"timestamp\":1794713986},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":13},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive lo